  "sample_mapping_evidence": "Original annotation pair selects pooled capture, explicit csp_code_n selects unpooled capture; literal original barcode selects count row. Deposited author sample aliases join supplementary WGS names and .best SNG.1ST calls with only an explicit optional_L00 suffix. No SNP/profile/genotype inference or ordinal donor assignment. Exact per-cell source/call disagreements excluded; every coded sample remains represented.",
  "physical_sample_mapping_evidence": "Sixty-two study-scoped coded sample/material groups, one retained capture view per explicit csp_code_n. The source data guide documents patient-ID matching via supplementary S1 and deposited sample/WGS aliases. Twelve unpooled rows share a no-WGS-needed placeholder; it is not a participant alias. Resequenced suffixes are explicitly linked by csp_code_n and do not add people. Counts represent study-coded groups, not globally verified independent participants.",
